  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPD. Capacity Partnerships and Access to Information for Sustainable Reintegration of Returnees in Iraq (CAIR II). 2023-2025.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to, through whole-of-government/whole-of-society and capacity partnerships approaches, to a sustainable reintegration of Iraqi returnees, individuals as well as families, in their communities of return in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
